{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act41side_level_act41side_02_end",
  "groupId": "act41side",
  "stageId": "act41side_02",
  "title": "不过别离",
  "storyCode": "EA-2",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act41side/level_act41side_02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "32f65a898d39cc88495c63e6d482e3a3760ee515f183dc4dd085896d2c0a8b11",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一条有人住的街道都走过了，没有提奥的下落，只看到城里人身上的火......越来越旺盛，就好像忽然起风了一样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且每个人都习以为常，祛除火焰只会让他们陷入惊恐，觉得没了火的部分在离自己远去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "难道纳斯尔纱人真的已经......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不，先别想那些，孩子要紧。该去碰碰涅梅丝说过的那位游牧民布莉吉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......真有人会因为进不去黑林，就在城门外搭帐篷吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“沿着岗哨右边走出去，蹚过小河”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_campsite_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好像到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "金色头发的佩洛，高高大大，但很灵巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这应该就是涅梅丝说的“布莉吉”——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你认识我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我们从前应该没见过，是涅梅丝让我来找你的。我叫苇草。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拉芙希妮只看见对方往自己身前凑过来，鼻子翕动了两下，还以为这是什么游牧民的招呼方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是城里那条红龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么？我不是红龙，我只是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是城里那条红龙，你是另一条红龙。另一条红龙回到城市里......好耳熟的故事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是闻了闻，就......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，你身上的火的味道和城里那条红龙一点都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过这都不重要。苇草，你来找我做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥失踪了，听说你回城的时候常找他聊天，所以涅梅丝让我来问问你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥失踪了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥今天早上出去就没回家，今天城里又乱作一团。先是涅梅丝，然后是我，我们找遍了整个纳斯尔纱，都找不到他的下落。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我离开纳斯尔纱之前还去找过他，他那时候还好好的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，他那时候的情况也算不上好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎么说，我找了提奥之后去了趟堡垒，然后就出了城，在那之后就没见过提奥的影子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，他现在到底在哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltstrongpoint"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥——提奥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，我当时就该直接把他打晕，扛在肩上带走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥，说话！这回你必须跟我走了，提奥！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉，这里是......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战争期间这处地块曾经被拖出去，据说是平定哪里的贵族什么的，拖回来就这样了，挂在纳斯尔纱上，一直也没人修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥一受了什么委屈就爱往这儿跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许提奥真的出城了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我只见过一个出城的人，就是拉格兰街的艾玛。当时没看见提奥和她一起离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且她一个人押着好多东西在黑林外面和人碰了头，那人把东西拉走，她就一个人回来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她没注意到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城里人的眼睛耳朵鼻子都不好使。再说我们离得远着呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好多东西出去，一个人回来......她哪来的东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛是做什么的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她经营一家粮店，我去那里送过信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "粮店......出城......现在闭门不出......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在也只有这么点线索了。我们赶紧过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "59_g1_citystreets_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉？苇草？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你好，请问你有没有看见提奥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "提奥？涅梅丝把这事交给你了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没。天知道那小子又跑哪儿去了，别是跟着烧了农业地块的间谍一起跑了才好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布莉吉，找人要紧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那艾玛呢，你看见她了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "友善的居民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1688_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她早早就关店了。我也就是来转转，看看她是不是还能开门......唉，白费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，又来了，这股冰冷的焦煳味儿......最近整个纳斯尔纱都是这股味道......真难闻啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直想问，你能闻到紫火的气味？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，那条红龙身上紫火的煳味。最近连城里人都腌入味了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不只是气味......火已经蔓延到城里人身上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？可我没看见那些人身上有火啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来你也看不见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我倒要问你呢，原来你能看见？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不过，唉，想想也是，毕竟你也是红龙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城里的人们和那条红龙离得这么近，又把她奉若神明，惹火上身确实是早晚的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛，是我，布莉吉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "艾玛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锁孔里有你说的紫火的味道。肯定有人在里面。怎么办，闯进去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......也只能这样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布莉吉",
      "speakerId": "avg_4177_brigid_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来红龙的火还能烧开锁头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉芙希妮",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1694_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......不管怎么说，我们先进去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g6_noblelivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，“酷吏”先生，喝一杯。虽说没有宴席，酒还是管够的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瞧瞧是谁来了？这不是我们的“守灵人”吗？你也收到领袖的邀请了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来......呈奉守灵人献给红龙的祭器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看守灵人送来了什么好东西......哨笛，然后呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夏末节将至，守灵人的确没有多余的祭器，只能送来这枚哨笛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这就没了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是你自己信誓旦旦地向我们保证，会带祭器来为庆典增光吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，是我考虑不周......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了吧，这事也不是涅梅丝自己提的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“歌唱家”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_247",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打一开始我就说了，一帮整天和逝者啊灵魂啊打交道的人，送来的东西也不吉利，还不如就拿来一枚哨笛呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你被“守灵人”救过，你当然替她说好话了！这事不能就这么算了！“守灵人”，你说，这事你怎么负责？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安静！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不是她一个人能负责的事。真要追究，守灵人对领袖不敬的这笔账可以过后算。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "祭器的事暂且放下，领袖让我先来，让大家先尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "困难期间，一切从简，本次典礼不设宴席。在领袖驾临之前，各位就先自行放松吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“守灵人”，你先别走。等领袖来了，你得给她一个交待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，你也可以趁现在去巴结几位大员，让他们一会儿为你美言几句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你倒很正直。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "涅梅丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1692_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“校官”先生，这些人......他们真的一向如此吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，一向如此？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，他曾经为了银石崖前线的后勤殚精竭虑，几日几夜没合眼，累到差点在纳斯尔纱的农业地块昏死过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“酷吏”，他是个铁石心肠的恶棍，但战争期间，纳斯尔纱附近囤粮的豪商和贵族只要听见他的名字，腿就吓得发软。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“拷问者”，我见过他以听别人哀号和惨叫为乐，可也见过他如同一条发疯的牙兽，冲入敌人的军阵......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“校官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_723_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可现在呢？如果不是殿下否决，城里已经困难到这种地步，这些人恐怕还想着一顿丰盛的晚宴呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我们的“校官”先生还是那么不合群。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，倒是你，你怎么了？你兴致也不高？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "城里现在缺粮，我有责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗐，粮食歉收，能怎么办？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）再说，我不是给你出嫁祸维多利亚人的主意了吗？那个艾玛也照你教的说了，城里人也上钩了，你现在慌什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）城里就算真饿起肚子了，那些人把领袖当成什么似的，肯定也不会冲着我们来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）难道那个艾玛要反水？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）那倒不是。她自打回来就心神不宁，不过既然已经老老实实照我们说的做，我就不慌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）我现在担心的是和艾玛接头的那个商人，一点音讯都没有。放在以前，今天上午就该有信儿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（耳语）那就是耽搁了呗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "二位偷偷聊什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个，我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们在说那个英雄库林的事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他？他怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他当年说的是自己在黑林里借着地形弄死了一整队维多利亚斥候，四五个人，最后剩了个孩子没忍心下手，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你自己想，一队斥候怎么会带个孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“拷问者”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1749_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？“守灵人”解释过，那队斥候是挟持了一帮以前往来塔拉和维多利亚的商队，帮他们在黑林里带的路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“监察官”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商队多半是有的，可斥候......哼，我看啊，不好说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“可斥候......哼，我看啊，不好说。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "作家讲得口渴，抓起杯子仰头，可啤酒已经喝干了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再去为您叫一杯啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "神秘的女性起身去了吧台，作家则顺势靠在椅背上。\n多年的习惯让他盘算着该如何将接下来的部分讲得引人入胜，可盘算着盘算着，他心里突然一紧。\n即便这女人姑且也算是自己的难友，知道些有的没的，至少接下来这一段自己决不该像之前那样和盘托出。\n天知道她会不会出去乱说。\n这是故事。故事是火映在墙上的影子，而不是火焰本身。讲故事的人需要牢记这一点，不然只会被火焰焚身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您的啤酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢。让我想想，刚才讲到哪里了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的女性",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深池在庆功会上的丑态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，是的，丑态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "作家",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1698_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，这场庆功会真正的主角马上就要登场......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "34_g6_noblelivingroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "这场庆功会真正的主角马上就要登场。\n但在那之前，深池的丑态仍在持续，让人无法直视。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，我倒是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我头顶是不是有什么东西爬过去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，天气都这么冷了，纳斯尔纱居然还有虫子。你别动，我把它抓下来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "宴会厅突然静了下来。\n所有人都盯着“官僚”的头顶，那里停着一只甲虫。\n纯金的甲虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“酷吏”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_234",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，是你背后的陈设掉下来了。给，你自己放回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“酷吏”把甲虫从“官僚”头顶取下，放在他的手里。\n“官僚”松了口气，正想把甲虫放回原位，甲虫却抖了抖嵌满钻石的翅膀，往门口飞了一段，落在了大厅中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他往前追了两步，那甲虫仿佛引诱他似的，也往前爬了一段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好兴致啊，“官僚”先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我、我只是想为您追回这只乱跑的甲虫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。我又怎么会责怪你呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不见怪就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，关于之前向您禀报的祭器的事情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种小事，无关紧要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正重要的是，我忠心的仆臣们......你们应当为这场胜利受到奖赏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爱布拉娜从地上拾起那枚甲虫，摊平掌心，甲虫“嗡”的一声飞向门口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "诸位，我们此刻置身的不是别处，正是过去的盖尔王陈列珍宝的厅堂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里的陈设曾尽数被维多利亚人夺走，而今，我们终于将其中的大多数放归原位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“官僚”，刚刚那枚甲虫，正是盖尔王赐予能臣的奖励，赞扬他如同不知疲倦的甲虫，将每一粒谷物收入府库之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你的确值得它。如果没有你，我们的军队恐怕已经因饥饿而不知溃散多少次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去追上它吧，它是你的了。只要它还愿意停留在你身边，你就可以执掌征收谷物的权力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“官僚”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_246",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "爱布拉娜扫视房间内的人群。\n有的人直勾勾地盯着“官僚”的背影，想着自己会受赐什么，另一些人则控制不住地看向房间内的其他珍藏。\n执掌刑律的宝剑，倾听申诉的云兽，记录历史的绳结，象征悲悯的水晶泪滴......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来，各位都已经等不及了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么不如这样，请各位不必拘谨，将自己最想要的东西握在手中，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "顷刻之间，一切珍宝都仿佛有了生命似的动了起来。\n云兽奔跑，水晶滚落，绳结扭动，连镶满萨尔贡宝石的仪式剑，也从架上挣脱，甚至带着些滑稽，一跳一跳地朝着门外的方向而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "爱布拉娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_450_necras_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去吧，我忠心的仆臣们。这就是我给你们的赏赐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
